<h2 id="what-other-lldb-debugging-tools-are-there">What other lldb debugging tools are there?</h2>

<p><a href="https://github.com/DerekSelander/LLDB">lldb_commands</a> is another third-party lldb extension library that provides many practical file operations.</p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ls</code>: list the directory or files at a specified path
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">pexecutable</code>: print the location of the current executable
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">dumpenv</code>: view environment info, e.g. the sandbox path
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">yoink</code>: copy files from a specified directory to the mac’s temp directory
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">keychain</code>: view keychain info</p>

